# MemPalace MCP (server name usually `mempalace`)

When calling MCP on **`mempalace`**, use **only** tools whose names start with **`mempalace_`**.

**These names do not exist — never call them:** `query_memories`, `check_memories`, `save_memory`, `get_memory`.

| Intent | Tool |
|--------|------|
| Search / recall | **`mempalace_search`** (`query`, `limit`; optional **`wing`**: `News Intelligence`) |
| Wings / taxonomy / structure | **`mempalace_list_wings`**, **`mempalace_get_taxonomy`**, **`mempalace_list_rooms`** |
| Duplicate / overlap check | **`mempalace_check_duplicate`** |
| Read / write drawers | **`mempalace_get_drawer`**, **`mempalace_add_drawer`**, **`mempalace_update_drawer`**, **`mempalace_list_drawers`** |
| After external writes / mine | **`mempalace_reconnect`** |

If unsure what is registered (MCPO container running), list tool names:

`docker exec ai-lab-mcp-gateway /usr/local/bin/python3 -c 'import mempalace.mcp_server as m; print("\n".join(sorted(m.TOOLS)))'`
